# Build context filter for Dockerfile.vercel (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to .dockerignore, which here is the
# release image's and keeps only linux/ and LICENSE). The Go build needs the
# sources, go.mod and go.sum; everything generated or unrelated stays out.
.git
.vercel
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/.source
**/.generated
**/test-output
**/*.tsbuildinfo
docs
examples
skills
